  "id": "BIT-discourse-2026-72725",
  "summary": "Discourse: Stored XSS in staff action logs injects staff UI",
  "details": "Discourse is an open-source discussion platform. Prior to 2026.1.6, the staff action log model rendered unescaped previous and new value fields that could inject stored cross-site scripting into the staff interface. The issue is fixed in 2026.1.6, 2026.5.2, 2026.6.1, and 2026.7.0.",
